{
  "message": "Your “Sprint 2” devlog reports new gameplay, but its photograph and film thumbnail leave progress unknown. At halfway, the slice remains at risk without playable evidence, a common gap still fixable here. Drop the trailer storyboard and use sprint 3 to share an openable build with both islands, tides and two-player sailing. I’ll meet you after sprint 3 and look forward to your build and devlog updates ;)",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Drop the trailer storyboard to protect the remaining time for the playable slice.",
      "itemId": "cmvzgwd4x00k9kmz8pv2k29qp",
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "By the end of sprint 3, share an openable rough build with both islands, the tide loop and two-player sailing. Include instructions for starting a co-op session.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "In sprint 4, test the build with five players. Publish session notes covering tides, sailing, where players got stuck and what needs changing.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

